# OS generated files #
######################
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
.idea/
# No trailing slash: build worktrees get node_modules as a SYMLINK, and a
# `dir/` pattern only ever matches a real directory.
node_modules
.github

# Shopify CLI files
.shopify/
shopify.theme.toml
assets/

# Generated languages files
languages/

# Generated codebase map — derived from source via `yarn map`; regenerated on
# install (postinstall) + after structural changes. Local-only to avoid merge
# conflicts and staleness in VCS.
PROJECT-MAP.md

## Release files
release
*.zip

# Residue from the pre-worktree test-presets, which swapped preset JSON over the working tree.
# Nothing writes it any more; the ignore stays so an old leftover cannot be committed.
.json_backup/

## Terser name cache (for deterministic minification)
.terser-name-cache.json

# Agent skills — node_modules only, skill files are committed
.agents/skills/*/node_modules/
.claude/skills/*/node_modules/

# Claude session locks (per-process, never commit)
.claude/*.lock

# Parallel-build worktrees (created by /build-batch, per-machine, never commit).
# Kept OUTSIDE .claude/ so Cursor/VS Code auto-detects them in Source Control:
# `git.repositoryScanMaxDepth` is 2 here (see .vscode/settings.json), and
# .claude/worktrees/<slug> sat one level too deep. It also keeps a checked-out
# copy of the theme out of Claude's own config namespace.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/

# L2 runtime-tester evidence (screenshots) — throwaway, agent should delete it
.l2-evidence/

# Section/block briefs — per-dev scratch specs (Phase 1 Think), not shared. The
# `_TEMPLATE.md` stays tracked as the format reference; everything else is local.
# EXCEPT archive/: `wt:clean` moves a merged feature's brief there — the agreed
# spec of live code IS shared (committed), so /revise works from the real spec.
# Kept OUTSIDE .claude/ (moved from .claude/briefs/): Claude Code gates every
# edit under .claude/ behind the "edit its own settings" confirm, which
# permissions.allow cannot silence — briefs must live elsewhere to be
# editable silently by design-to-brief and /revise.
.briefs/*
!.briefs/_TEMPLATE.md
!.briefs/archive
!.briefs/archive/**

# Claude toolkit: per-developer local overrides — never commit (kept out of the
# core→child sync). The rest of .claude/ IS committed and inherited from core.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local-only: overview giữa các chat (không commit)
.cursor/chat-summary-latest.md
.cursor/chat-summaries/

# Generated from the motion registry — yarn motion:manifest
.motion-manifest.json


# audit-coverage fixtures + reports (scripts/audit-coverage.mjs) — generated, never commit
templates/*.audit-*.json
layout/audit.liquid
.audit-coverage/
.audit-url/
